    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE HORDE OF GOBLINS IN THE MINES!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/b2b83c2eeee08784c9d93b199c5cc6f8.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/b2b83c2eeee08784c9d93b199c5cc6f8.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/b2b83c2eeee08784c9d93b199c5cc6f8.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Mine and collect gold and minerals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your workers to mine and collect resources, with satisfying block breaking ways!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/c7b905cde514efd77baa7da05b954c9b.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/c7b905cde514efd77baa7da05b954c9b.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/c7b905cde514efd77baa7da05b954c9b.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your towers and upgrade them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varity of towers to choose from, from miniguns and canons, to sawblades!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/5eadd15165b5f8008633a9f1dd23442c.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/5eadd15165b5f8008633a9f1dd23442c.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/5eadd15165b5f8008633a9f1dd23442c.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find treasure boxes and choose power ups!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up yourself, your dwarves, and towers, with unique power ups!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/1ab3d7cd5c4ce63355a0b6908252be2e.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/1ab3d7cd5c4ce63355a0b6908252be2e.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/1ab3d7cd5c4ce63355a0b6908252be2e.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique traps in each level!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush the goblins with unique and fun traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/b455728021ee34fb874511ee02c86eeb.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/b455728021ee34fb874511ee02c86eeb.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/b455728021ee34fb874511ee02c86eeb.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face elite units!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself for the biggest battle in the mines, ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/49c15932c2c196cb35543844a68db9d6.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/49c15932c2c196cb35543844a68db9d6.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/49c15932c2c196cb35543844a68db9d6.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your different weapons to combat thieving goblins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistol, AK47, RPG, and more coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/788127642cef1def186885d1f0b00fc5.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/788127642cef1def186885d1f0b00fc5.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/788127642cef1def186885d1f0b00fc5.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/63ec674fcc01771fe7cfcb198d93218a.poster.avif?t=1755513852\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/63ec674fcc01771fe7cfcb198d93218a.webm?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552840/extras/63ec674fcc01771fe7cfcb198d93218a.mp4?t=1755513852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
